#: eucitizensciencetheme/templates/about.html:92
msgid "The Platform"
msgstr "Platforma"

#: eucitizensciencetheme/templates/about.html:97
msgid ""
"EU-Citizen.Science is an online platform for sharing knowledge, tools, training and "
"resources for citizen science – by the community, for the community."
msgstr ""
"EU-Citizen.Science é uma plataforma online para partilha de conhecimentos, "
"ferramentas, formação e recursos de ciência cidadã - pela comunidade, para a "
"comunidade."

#: eucitizensciencetheme/templates/about.html:98
msgid ""
"The vision for the platform is to serve as a Knowledge Hub, in aid of the "
"mainstreaming of citizen science, and build on the growing impact of citizens "
"participating in research across the full range of scientific enquiry. We accomplish "
"this by supporting the sharing of knowledge, know-how, and experience between anyone "
"doing or wanting to do citizen science."
msgstr ""
"Vizí platformy je sloužit jako znalostní centrum, které napomáhá začleňování občanské "
"vědy do hlavních témat a staví na rostoucím vlivu občanů zapojených do výzkumu v celé "
"škále vědeckého bádání. Toho dosahujeme podporou sdílení znalostí, know-how a "
"zkušeností mezi kýmkoli, kdo se občanské vědě věnuje nebo chce věnovat."

#: eucitizensciencetheme/templates/about.html:99
msgid "On this platform you will find:"
msgstr "Na této platformě najdete:"

#: eucitizensciencetheme/templates/about.html:107
msgid "that are useful for citizen science practitioners"
msgstr "které jsou užitečné pro praktiky občanské vědy"

