"The resource refers to any <b>impact</b> that it could have (or has had) on science, "
"policy, society, etc."
msgstr ""
"Zdroj označuje jakýkoli <b>dopad</b>, který by mohl mít (nebo měl) na vědu, politiku, "
"společnost atd."

